('reading', 'summary_completion', 'Science', 'hard', 6.5, 'Complete the summary using NO MORE THAN ONE WORD: Déjà vu may occur when the familiarity system fires strongly but the ______ system retrieves nothing.', '22000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006', null, null, '"recollection"', 'The passage states déjà vu "may represent a rare instance in which the familiarity system fires with unusual strength while the recollection system finds nothing to retrieve."', 'Since "familiarity" is already given, the missing word must be the other of the two processes named in the dual-process model.', '{"summary_completion"}', 50, 11, false),
