('reading', 'short_answer', 'Science', 'medium', 6, 'According to the final paragraph, understanding déjà vu''s mechanics could eventually help with the study of what kind of conditions?', '22000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006', null, null, '["memory disturbances","more serious memory disturbances","chronic déjà vu"]', 'The final paragraph states understanding the mechanism "could eventually inform the study of more serious and persistent memory disturbances, including rare conditions in which patients experience chronic, near-constant feelings of déjà vu."', 'The concluding paragraph of a passage often generalises from the specific topic to a broader field of application — check the final sentences for this kind of forward-looking claim.', '{"short_answer"}', 55, 14, false),
