('52000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007', 'part1', 'group-friend-influence', 'Friendship', null, '["Do you have a close friend?","How did you meet your closest friend?","What do you usually do together with your friends?","Do you think it is important to have many friends?"]'),
('52000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008', 'part2', 'group-friend-influence', 'A friend who has influenced you', 'Describe a friend who has influenced you. You should say: who this friend is, how you met, what this friend does or has done, and explain how this friend has influenced you.', '["Describe a friend who has influenced you."]'),
