('52000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000017', 'part2', 'group-place-visit-wish', 'A place you would like to visit', 'Describe a place you would like to visit in the future. You should say: where this place is, how you learned about it, what you would like to do there, and explain why you would like to visit this place.', '["Describe a place you would like to visit in the future."]'),
('52000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000018', 'part3', 'group-place-visit-wish', 'Travel planning and tourism choices', null, '["What factors do people usually consider when choosing a holiday destination?","How has the internet changed the way people plan their travels?","Do you think it is better to travel to well-known destinations or to less popular places?","What impact does tourism have on the culture of a destination?"]'),
