('52000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000026', 'part2', 'group-famous-building', 'A famous building you have visited', 'Describe a famous building you have visited. You should say: where it is, what it looks like, why it is famous, and explain what you thought of it.', '["Describe a famous building you have visited."]'),
